===Etymology===
{{PIE root|nl|(s)ker}}
From {{inh|nl|dum|scheren}}, from {{etyl|odt|nl}} {{term|skeran|lang=odt}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|nl}} {{m|gem-pro|*skeraną}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|nl}} {{m|ine-pro|*(s)ker-||to cut}}. Akin to Low German {{term|scheren|lang=nds}}, German {{term|scheren|lang=de}}, West Frisian {{term|skeare|lang=fy}}, English {{term|shear||lang=en}}, Danish {{term|skære|lang=da}}.

===Verb===
{{nl-verb|schoor|geschoren}}

# to [[shave]]
# to [[shear]]

